 "about_item": "Material:Made of premium 50% polyester 50% cotton fleece material, this women’s pullover hoodie is thick, soft and breathable. The quality fabric keeps you warm and cozy through fall, winter and lightweight for all-day comfy wear.   Design:This oversized hoodie boasts a flattering relaxed fit with drop shoulders, a big hood and roomy kangaroo pocket for your precious things. Available in black, grey, pink and so on, the loose silhouette fits all figures for casual street style.   Match:A staple for women’s fall wardrobes. This aesthetic sweatshirt layers over tank tops, crop tops and underscrubs, pairing easily with jeans, joggers, leggings for daily casual outfits.   Occasion:This comfy warm pullover fits loungewear, school, office, parties, gym, yoga, hiking, biking and skating. Cute quality clothes for indoor relaxation and outdoor fall activities.   Care: Machine wash cold gentle cycle or hand wash, do not bleach. Shrink-proof material stays soft, retains its shape and vivid color after repeated washes for long-lasting quality.",
