 "top_reviews": [
  {
   "reviewer": "Wess Vandenbark",
   "rating": 5,
   "title": "Everyday hoodie for staying cozy",
   "date": "September 24, 2026",
   "country": "United States",
   "variant": "Size: XX-Small Color: Grey",
   "verified_purchase": true,
   "helpful_votes": 1,
   "body": "Exactly what I wanted for my small apartment life. I work from home a lot, so I needed something comfy that still looks okay on quick Zoom calls. This hoodie is big and slouchy in a good way, but I don’t feel like I’m drowning in it. The fleece inside feels soft right away, no weird scratchy lining. I’m 5'5\", around 155 lbs, and I grabbed a medium for that oversized look. It hits below my hips and covers my leggings, which I love. Threw it on the other night to run downstairs to grab packages and didn’t even bother with a jacket because it was warm enough 👍. The big kangaroo pocket actually holds my phone and keys without them falling out, which made me really glad I bought it 😊."
  },
  {
   "reviewer": "Gina Marie",
   "rating": 5,
   "title": "Soooo comfortable! You won’t be disappointed",
   "date": "April 9, 2026",
   "country": "United States",
   "variant": "Size: Large Color: Coffee Grey",
   "verified_purchase": true,
   "helpful_votes": 61,
   "body": "I am absolutely obsessed with the Trendy Queen Women’s Oversized Hoodies! We now have almost every color, and I can honestly say they are some of the most comfortable hoodies I’ve ever owned. The material is soft, cozy, and perfect for lounging at home or running errands in style. The oversized fit is ideal—it’s roomy without being overwhelming, and it drapes beautifully. I love that it works well with leggings, jeans, or even just as a comfy layer over pajamas. The quality is surprisingly good for the price, and after multiple washes, they’ve held up really well with no shrinking or pilling. Whether you’re looking for comfort, style, or just a hoodie that you’ll actually want to live in, these definitely hit the mark. You won’t be disappointed! Highly recommend stocking up on multiple colors."
  },
  {
   "reviewer": "MLS",
   "rating": 5,
   "title": "High-Quality, Thick Sweatshirt — Great Price, Just Size Down",
   "date": "December 14, 2025",
   "country": "United States",
   "variant": "Size: Medium Color: Dusty Blue",
   "verified_purchase": true,
   "helpful_votes": 73,
   "body": "This is one of the highest-quality sweatshirts I’ve purchased at such a great price. The fabric is thick, soft, and very warm, and it feels well made right out of the package. It definitely runs oversized, so I would recommend sizing down if you don’t want an overly baggy fit. I typically wear a large, but I ordered a medium, and it fits me perfectly. The medium is comparable in size to my large sweatshirts from other brands. It did shrink slightly with the first wash, which I was actually happy about — when I tried it on straight out of the package, it was quite large on me. After washing, the fit was much better and still very roomy and comfortable. As with most materials, any stains should be treated before washing to keep it looking its best. Overall, this is an excellent sweatshirt for the price, especially if you’re looking for something warm, cozy, and well made — just be mindful of the sizing."
  },
  {
   "reviewer": "Kaylee",
   "rating": 4,
   "title": "good quality!",
   "date": "September 23, 2026",
   "country": "United States",
   "variant": "Size: XX-Large Color: Coffee Grey",
   "verified_purchase": true,
   "helpful_votes": 1,
   "body": "fits great! looks great! very comfy! I’d love it a tad more if it was a little heavier!"
  },
  {
   "reviewer": "Ava Fleman",
   "rating": 5,
   "title": "Comfy sweatshirt",
   "date": "September 8, 2026",
   "country": "United States",
   "variant": "Size: X-Large Color: Black",
   "verified_purchase": true,
   "helpful_votes": 4,
   "body": "Good quality sweatshirt without costing too much. I bought this sweatshirt a few months back and I wear this sweatshirt pretty frequently because it’s comfy and the appearance of the sweatshirt is how it’s shown in the pictures. I have washed this sweatshirt a lot, and all I will say is wash it maybe inside out to prevent any color fading. But I haven’t noticed any lose material or holes so I would say this is a durable sweatshirt that will last for a while. I bought a size up just because I like a baggier fit so if you like the same I would buy a size up to your normal size. I would repurchase again"
  },
