   "body": "I really love this hoodie! I bought it after spending $40 on a Comfrt brand hoodie, and wanted to find something similar but less expensive. I’d say this is really similar to that brand, slightly less weighted, and a little more “roomie”. comfrt seems to be more “form fitting” while still oversized, if that makes sense! I’m a tts medium, but wanted to trust Amazons recommendation of a large, and bought the large. I would probably buy again in a medium, however, the large still fits great. It’s VERY soft on the inside and out, thick but not too heavy, has good stretch, and is designed “oversized”. I would recommend staying true to size for an oversized look, size down 2 to fit snugly, and size up one to be extra oversized. It’s warm! I went for a walk outdoors in a t shirt with this hoodie overtop, on a 45°, very sunny day… shortly into my walk I was the perfect temp! The hood is very oversized and very soft! Also the inside of the hood is the same color as the hoodie, not white, which is a small detail that is important to me. I’ve washed and worn it several times already, I dry on low heat and did not notice any shrinking. The color stays true and there has been no pilling on the outside I can notice. The inside DOES shed a little but with each wash it’s been less and less noticeable, without sacrificing the softness. I bought this on a lightning deal for I think $23, and to me that’s about what it’s worth. I don’t like spending a ton of money on clothing in general, but would probably spend $30 or less on this hoodie. I’m waiting for another good sale to snag another color ☺️"
